  "name": "SW_EFIx_LP_HM",
  "alternateName": "Extended dataset of the Electric field instrument (EFI) Langmuir probe (LP) measurements at 2Hz",
  "description": "Extended Swarm Electric field instrument (EFI) data from the Langmuir probes (LP) in the so-called “harmonic submode”, with a 2 Hz cadence. The dataset contains the electron temperature and spacecraft potential measured separately by the two probes.",
